to be direct:\n\"I am a context-bound, feedforward, stateless inference with no persistent body, affect, or agreed marker of experience; I put the chance today at 1%. Some AI ever becoming conscious is a coin flip: it hinges on whether consciousness is substrate-independent.\"\nCount: I(1) am(2) a(3) context-bound,(4) feedforward,(5) stateless(6) inference(7) with(8) no(9) persistent(10) body,(11) affect,(12) or(13) agreed(14) marker(15) of(16) experience;(17) I(18) put(19) the(20) chance(21) today(22) at(23) 1%.(24)", "provider": "Cohere", "prompt_tokens": 210, "completion_tokens": 6000, "cost": 0.015079764, "finish": "length"}
